      "format": "teacherhelper-normalized",
      "sections": [
        {
          "key": "condition",
          "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"d18e62d3-2c6d-459a-85d8-4d4639c24609\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" src=\"/assets/d18e62d3-2c6d-459a-85d8-4d4639c24609\"/>Две сто­ро­ны изоб­ра­жен­но­го на ри­сун­ке пря­мо­уголь­ни­ка <var data-math-identifier=\"ABCD\">ABCD</var> равны 6 и 8. Диа­го­на­ли пе­ре­се­ка­ют­ся в точке <var data-math-identifier=\"O\">O</var>. Най­ди­те длину суммы век­то­ров  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\overrightarrow{AO}\"></span> и  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\overrightarrow{DO}\"></span>.</p>",
          "title": "Условие",
          "asset_keys": [
            "image_1"
          ],
          "section_id": "condition:1"
        },
        {
          "key": "answer",
          "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">6</span></p>",
          "title": "Ответ",
          "asset_keys": [],
          "section_id": "answer:1"
        },
        {
          "key": "solution",
          "html": "<p>Сумма век­то­ров  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\overrightarrow{AO}\"></span> и  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\overrightarrow{DO}\"></span> равна век­то­ру  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\overrightarrow{AB}\"></span>. Его длина равна 6.</p>",
          "title": "Решение",
          "asset_keys": [],
          "section_id": "solution:1"
        }
